14, so my estimate is 50,000,000 + 1,169,614 = 51,169,614. I should verify this by multiplying back: 95,477 × 51,169,614.\n\nBreaking this into parts, I get 95,477 × 50,000,000 = 4,773,850,000,000, plus 95,477 × 1,169,614. For the second part, I can split it as 95,477 × 1,000,000 = 95,477,000,000, plus 95,477 × 169,614. To compute 95,477 × 169,614, I'll use 95,477 × (170,000 - 386). First, 95,477 × 170,000 requires 95,477 × 17 × 10,000. Computing 95,477 × 17 by breaking it as (15 + 2): 95,477 × 15 = 1,432,155 and 95,477 × 2 = 190,954, giving 1,623,109. So 95,477 × 170,000 = 16,231,090,000. Now I need 95,477 × 386 to complete the calculation.\n\nFor 95,477 × 386, I'll express it as 95,477 × (400 - 14) = 38,190,800 - 95,477 × 14. Computing 95,477 × 14 = 95,477 × 2 × 7 = 190,954 × 7 = 1,336,678. So 95,477 × 386 = 36,854,122. Working back: 95,477 × 169,614 = 16,231,090,000 - 36,854,122 = 16,194,235,878. Then 95,477 × 1,169,614 = 95,477,000,000 + 16,194,235,878 = 111,671,235,878. The full product is 4,773,850,000,000 + 111,671,235,878 = 4,885,521,235,878. The remainder is 4,885,521,246,185 - 4,885,521,235,878 = 10,307, which is less than 95,477, confirming the quotient is 51,169,614.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33007,"cache_read_input_tokens":20965,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33007},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"03c72ba8-d605-e770-8a63-f881ffd0f9d5","uuid":"dc4e25bc-c676-4456-84b2-6b7877e937f4"}
